  "prefLabel": "Lot 6000 RULES OF SECOND CHANCE DRAWINGS",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Lot 6000 RULES OF SECOND CHANCE DRAWINGS\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nPursuant to 2004, 97:1-9, effective 7-10-04, the Sweepstakes Commission was renamed the Lottery Commission. The rules filed in Chapter Sw 6000 by the Sweepstakes Commission before 7-10-04 and by the Lottery Commission after 7-10-04 reflected the title “Sw” of the former Sweepstakes Commission. They were editorially renumbered as Chapter Lot 6000 in November, 2020 to indicate rules of the Lottery Commission.",
